Let me take you out to dinner tonight, my treat.

22
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:57,320
Oh, that sounds great.

23
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:58,340
I'd love to.

24
00:00:59,080 --> 00:00:59,840
Here's my address.

25
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:01,440
Pick me up at eight.

26
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:02,120
Perfect.

27
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:17,350
Thank you for such a lovely evening.

28
00:01:17,590 --> 00:01:20,150
The food was amazing and I had a great time.

29
00:01:20,350 --> 00:01:20,730
Me too.

30
00:01:21,270 --> 00:01:23,230
You look so beautiful tonight.

31
