190
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,180
I wish this night would never end.

191
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:18,230
There's something that I have to tell you.

192
00:09:18,710 --> 00:09:19,430
But what is it?

193
00:09:19,830 --> 00:09:25,080
I woke up today thinking that this would be just like any other day, but I was wrong.

194
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:27,580
The twist of fate brought us together.

195
00:09:28,180 --> 00:09:33,460
I crashed into your life and you into mine and this may sound crazy, but I'm falling in love with you, Veronica.

196
00:09:49,390 --> 00:09:50,830
Okay so we're back.

197
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:55,490
Erica, I know you have a story of a twist of fate in your life.

198
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:56,070
Yes.

199
