200
00:09:58,850 --> 00:10:03,870
I went to this party and at the party there was a contest, like sort of a lottery.

201
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:10,160
You could buy some tickets and win a prize and the prize was a week-long vacation.

202
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:16,250
So I went with some friends of mine and they were tired so they left early and they gave me their tickets.

203
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:18,880
And guess what happened?

204
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,020
What happened?

205
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:20,000
We won.

206
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:21,980
We won the week-long vacation.

207
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,360
Wow.

208
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:23,740
Yeah, it was amazing.

209
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:27,380
So that was a really lucky twist of fate for me.

210
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:28,560
A lucky twist of fate.

211
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,240
That's a good story.

212
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,560
Yeah.

213
